  "article": {
    "body": "Sixth powerful attack submarine departs Barrow-in-Furness for sea trials, as announced by the UK Ministry of Defence on September 25. The submarine's trials mark a step forward in the nation's naval security efforts, according to the ministry. The UK government is also hosting the TF RAID Avengers: AI swarming competition, as per guidance published on the same day. The competition aims to advance autonomous AI technology, according to the ministry. Lattice's comprehensive port security was established at BlueTIDE 2026, as reported by Anduril on September 8, though details regarding the event and Lattice's role are unknown.",
